            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+n-type"} homotopy n-type
            (Assumption
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AssumptionForHigherGerbesOnSphericalSpaceForms"}
            below).
          %p
            The claim of Theorem
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ComparisonMapOfConcordanceInfinityGroupoidsIsEquivalence"}
            below is that this is equivalently the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hom+infinity-groupoid"}
