          %p Concretely, we consider the following situation:
          %p
          #AssumptionForHigherGerbesOnSphericalSpaceForms.num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p
              %strong Assumption.
              %br/
              In the following, let
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
