              %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^{n+2}/G
          itself, due to the condiiton that the
          = succeed "-action" do
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
