          %p
          #ComparisonMorphismBetweenShapesOfMappingStacks.num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p
              There is a canonical comparison morphism between the shapes of mapping stacks in Def.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ShapesOfMappingStacks"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/precomposition"} precomposition
              with the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/terminal+object"} terminal morphism
              = succeed ":" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
