          %p
          #ThePresentationsForShapesOfMappingStacksAreKanComplexes.num_lemma
            %h6 Lemma
            %p
              The simplicial set presentations for shapes of mapping stacks in Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ShapesOfMappingStacks"}
              have at least all 2-
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/horn"} horn
              fillers.
          .proof
