            %p
              When pulled back along the canonical topological horn filler retraction
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi Δ
                      %mn 2
                    %mo →
                    %msubsup
                      %mi Λ
                      %mn 1
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Delta^2 \to \Lambda^2_{1}
              this yields a 2-cell which fills the original 2-horn.
            %p
              Similarly, a
              = succeed "-horn" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msubsup
                        %mi Λ
                        %mn 0
                        %mn 2
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Lambda^2_0
